1
00:00:00,221 --> 00:00:02,721
-...and I realize you're not even there.
-I know.

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,100
(Raj:)And where were you?

3
00:00:04,266 --> 00:00:07,476
(Howard:)Getting shot down by the girl
at Hot Dog on a Stick.

4
00:00:08,312 --> 00:00:10,312
But in my defense, she was gorgeous.

5
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:12,821
(Howard:)And working that squeezer
to make the lemonade...

6
00:00:12,983 --> 00:00:16,113
(Howard:)...going up and down
and up and down....

7
00:00:16,529 --> 00:00:20,619
(Howard:)It was like a free pole dance
right in the middle of the food court.

8
00:00:21,367 --> 00:00:22,447
(Raj:)You're impossible.

9
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:26,620
(Howard:)Hey, at least I can talk to women
without being drunk.

10
00:00:26,789 --> 00:00:30,709
(Raj:)Excuse me, I have selective mutism,
a recognized medical disorder.

11
00:00:30,876 --> 00:00:33,216
(Raj:)You're just a douche.

12
00:00:34,255 --> 00:00:35,335
(Howard:)No. You know what?

13
00:00:35,506 --> 00:00:37,586
(Howard:)Maybe that's what this whole thing
is about.

14
00:00:37,758 --> 00:00:39,968
(Howard:)You're not mad at me.
You're mad at yourself.

15
00:00:40,135 --> 00:00:43,805
(Raj:)No, I'm mad at you.
I hate myself, but I'm mad at you.

16
00:00:44,223 --> 00:00:47,013
Look, fine. You're mad at me. I get it.
Now--

17
00:00:47,768 --> 00:00:50,768
(Howard:)How about we go
spend the day together?

18
00:00:50,938 --> 00:00:53,978
(Howard:)Just the two of us.
We'll go anywhere you want.

19
00:00:55,276 --> 00:00:56,816
(Leonard:)I don't know.

20
00:00:56,986 --> 00:00:59,026
(Raj:)Come on.

